How do people live in the oldest house of Ufa
In the former house of gold miners and miners Evdokim and his son Ivan Demidov on the street of the Oktyabrskaya revolution 57/1 (former Bolshaya Kazan) 18 apartments.
The house of the XVIII century has practically not changed since the time of the building, except for dilapidation.
Unauthorized strangers go here as an excursion, and the tenants suffer more than they rejoice, from their privilege - the right to live in the oldest Ufa house, the walls of which are remembered by commander Alexander Suvorov.
The date of construction of the house is inaccurate, historians point to two dates - 1730 and 1737.
But in any case, it turns out that the building is almost 300 years old.
The old yard, always an open door, a squeaking staircase.
Doors in the apartments are located close to each other, the walls cracked, and in the lucries from the plaster peel in some places you can see the street in some places.
It seems that everything is based on an honest word.
And the locals claim: "You don't think, it's like this."
To live in a wooden house of the XVIII century is very difficult, - says Tatiana Lukyanova, a resident of apartment No. 3.
The object is located on state security, but money for its maintenance is not allocated for decades, and we feel like museum exhibits, which the authorities have simply forgotten.
The last repair was 40 years ago.
The walls are still terribly and poor, but the foundation is all rotten.
Many tenants still go to the toilet in the street, and are washed once a week in a public bath.
How can you be satisfied in such conditions?
The road passes right under the windows, not even a pedestrian zone.
Tatiana moves the curiosity.
Now you can see the fact that it was only audible before: under the windows there is a flow of cars.
You see, the windows rattled constantly, the windows can not be opened, but we are accustomed to noise.
A person gets accustomed to everything, to the good and the bad.
Our apartment is still exemplary, thanked my husband, his hands are golden.
Moreover, the two rooms are with us, we live in the three with our son.
And in other families the conditions are much worse, on the second for the second floor in general the ceiling is a little more than one and a half meters high.
For the contrast, Tatiana proposes to come to visit a neighbour from Apartment No. 6 Lyudmila Starostina.
Pleasant hospitable woman from the threshold offers a cup of coffee and with a sad smite says:
We have a one-broom apartment, 14,5 m2 for four people, so we live: my husband and a daughter and a granddaughter.
I am here from the same time since I was born, there has never been another living space - Lyudmila wanders the room with his eyes: an unsettled, two sofa with the letter "g"; on one of them there is a granddaughter with a laptop.
Very circling and not much different from the usual domestic interior: only the ceilings are beautiful, "history".
But from the ceremonial regularly flocks: the plumbing system does not work anywhere.
Lyudmila speaks about her apartment ordinary and surprisingly at the same time as an Italian, whose house stands on the Roman ruins.
That is, it reduces into one very old and recent, everyday and legendary:
The leeten was carried out about 40 years ago during the last renovation.
At the same time they gave us a small kitchen in a griculette and a toilet from a former closet.
We live just where Demidov apartmented with his family, on the second floor there lived servants.
Our apartment is not privatized, and why?
In the Real Estate Center of Ufa they say that privatization does not matter.
Anyway, we will receive only a one-knack apartment, we can't qualify for more.
Already four months ago promised to relocated us, but it didn't go any further promises.
Not accustomed to complagerance and I won’t.
In this apartment (compartment!) lived a whole dynasty: my grandparents, a mother with a dad, my husband and my granddaughter with my granddaughter.
Anything has ever happened during that time.
Heat rats ran through the Kitchen, for example.
Take a look at the walls of the filament, they are a vocabulary of thickness!
They say that the solution was mixed on the ardants, so it lasts for so long.
The house is built thoroughly, thanks to Demidov!
Perhaps that's probably why no one has been killed by a collapsed ceiling or thug.
Only the building still slowly dies in front of our eyes: the plaques and logs of the house rot, the germs have repeatedly collapsed, we poured cement, but everything is useless - the solution goes to the ground, like a well.
They say, it is - under our room a secret climb and a move to the Belaya river, which the old people who once lived here specially made, so you can hide from the hazard, in the case of something.
They were persecuted.
Lyudmila Starostina tells how some historian came to them, begged to let him start an excavation apartment in an excavation apartment.
And then he persuaded to give them a dwelling in exchange for his alone on Oktyabr Prospekt.
Lyudmila the historian refused:
Where are we in the fourth one-stress?
And here at least there is a tiny hope that they will give the dwelling more spacious.
Accivize us for an exemplary exchange, we wouldn’t win anything anymore.
However, the Starness family didn't win anything.
Lyudmila’s greatest dream is to be resettled, and the daughter with a 16-year-old granddaughter was given a separate room.
That is, for two families allocated a two-broom apartment instead of not the most majestic ruins, in which two generations live now.
Cratious, a miniature girl Olesya Karsakova from apartments number 11 and 12 shows the second floor of the house.
In two cloak rooms with a total area of 23 m2, referred to in apartments, she lives a large family.
In total, there are seven of us, there are two children.
You can see for yourself.
Plaster falls off with pieces, as well as the window frames, in the walls in the kitchen and in the rooms end-and-to-end holes.
The faucet of the faucet is only cold all year round.
Having walked around the apartments of the oldest house of Ufa, you can make sure that most of all the spouse Lavrentiev from apartment No. 4.
They occupy the most spacious rooms of the first floor.
You're right, there's a lot of places!
Accommodation in 75 squares, registered three people.
We live just in those rooms, according to the legend Suvorov stayed during his stay in Ufa, - says the head of the family Alexander Dmitrievich Lavrentiev.
Ceilings are high, spacious.
Lone is bad - everything rakes at the seams, falls apart, collapsing.
Neighbours must have already told!
Most of the torments in our country with the floors: the wooden boards died, the ground literally went from under your feet.
I stupefies, wedges; there is nothing in the hall, and in the other room we go, like we swing on swing, so shaky.
About the house of the merchant Evdokim Demidov Alexander Dmitrievich can tell better than any guide.
The gold-derer is treated as a native, speaks with admiration.
Indeed, the personality was uncommerciful: the owner of Kaginsky and Uzyansky factories built houses, casting cannons and bells, holding Ural mines.
Sheavors of merchant's real estate progenuity are proud of the ancestor, but they do not want to live under the same roof with a history anymore.
I dwelt here still as a child, in the 40-ies of the XX century, - says Alexander Dmitrievich.
Then around there were wooden rooms for carets, stables and wardrobe boots, subsequently demolished.
In 1968 they wanted to relocate our house, but something was prevented ...
The story was repeated in 2014: again begged for a new dwelling.
We, as on command, we collected all the documents, avoided the necessary authorities, and suddenly found out that the move to the apartments is being postponed to 2015 or 2016.
We don't even believe all of this.
