In the Donetsk region are dealing with captured militants of the battalion “Donbass”.
Punishers were enclosed near Ilovaisk.
They were betrayed by their own commanders, and dozens of security forces died under fire.
Those who Survive said that if if they knew what the situation is actually in the south-east of Ukraine, they wouldn’t go to fight.
108 captivators can be called lucky ones.
Punishers from the battalion “Donbass” remained alive after the “meat grinder”, in which they fell near Ilovaisk.
Surrounded by the army of the Donetsk People's Republic, the militants spent several days, actually abandoned their commanders and the authorities of Ukraine.
When from the headquarters it was reported that it is possible to leave the "ningle" along an allegedly provided corridor, the convoy moved.
But after just a couple of minutes from all sides whistled shells and bullets.
Judging by the information that was given to me, we had a corridor, we were allowed to get out, – says the acting deputy commander of the Battalion, who has the call sign “Lermontov”.
And when we descended between the Polypoly and Chervonoselsky into the jungle, cross-fire began with anti-tank guided missiles, from “sons”, grenade launchers of 30-millimeter grenade launchers, BMD automatic cannons, and small-scale weapons.
In front of me there were four cars and in the rear of three, as a result of the cars there were only two.
The lieutenant officer with the call sign "Lermontov" says: almost at least at least 60 people were killed, dozens were wounded, many later died.
Surviviving militants are now being provided with medical care for those whom they came to kill.
Now the prisoners are amazed that the so-called "terrorists" treat them well, give food and medicines.
At a time when their own commanders actually deceived them and pronounced for certain death.
We've been betrayed simply," they said.
Column, the entire battalion to be destroyed.
In the battalion “Donbass”, like many of his comrades, Alexei acted as a volunteer, because in the Ukrainian news they talked about the atrocities that allegedly repaired in the south-east “separatists”.
Aleksey already saw a completely different picture.
His mother in Luhansk was killed - and not someone, but the Ukrainian military.
A friend called me, said that there is mortar shelling, which is most likely a Ukrainian armed forces, - says one of the soldiers, Alexei.
After that, I wanted to get out of the Battalion.
They didn’t let us out of Ilovaisk, they said that we were in the crucifix.
I have already agreed with the commander, the report has already written about leaving.
We were immediately taken to Ilovaisk from the cadets with Zurahovo immediately took me to Ilovaisk.
According to captivants, in the “cauldron” near Ilovaisk stranded a man of 300-350.
Now some survivors admit that, if it was possible to turn time back, they would not have joined the punitive Battalion for no reason.
Militants were handed over all the prisoners to the DNR security forces.
Everyone will be checked for involvement in war crimes.
