Milititials transferred more than 400 captivants to the Ukrainian military
In the “Army of Novorossiysk” claim that shot down the Ukrainian su-27, and accuse the enemy of violating the agreement on a ceasefire
The Militia as of 10:00 on September 1 handed the Ukrainian side 402 prisoners, 72 of whom were wounded, as well as the bodies of 35 dead servicemen.
