According to Tatiana Bogdanova, Head of the Department for Work with Subway Russia, about one-and-twentieth 80 per cent of its products are purchased in Russia, although there may be temporary difficulties in the supply of vegetables and an increase in prices for meat products, which are produced from imported raw materials.
