Propagão protests were held this weekend by those who spoke out against the NATO summit in Novosport.
Hundreds gathered in the center of Newport on Saturday for a march against NATO.
And on Sunday in Cardiff, about 150 people were gathered at Cardiff's Town Hall for what was described as an anti-summit.
