The socialists of France should “close and put France in the order”, says a key ally François of Hollande
Mr. Well called for a deeply divided leftist force to “demonstrate a warm attitude” to being attacked by a socialist president whose reshuffles didn’t find approval from the vast majority of the French.
The President deserves the respect of everyone, he deserves our loyalty, he deserves our support.
"It's our duty to stay next to him," he said, causing applause.
As a gesture of conciliation, the prime minister claimed that his government would not be summoned to the controversial 35-hour working week in France, despite conflict-inflicting proposals, it should loosen the rules made by Emmanuel Macron, the new economy minister, earlier this week.
On Saturday, Mr. Hollande begged his comrades-in-Syrian parties to remain “unified” with the government.
However, Kristian Tobira, the Minister of Justice, inserted sticks into the wheavals, coming to a meeting of dissatisfactory members of parliament from the Socialist Party and criticizing the Socialist Party for allowing the French to “lose faith in the future”.
Marín Le Pe, the leader of the far-right National Front, expressed conttempt for constant internal conflicts among the socialists, saying that she did not imagine that Valla’s new government would last more than a few months.
François Hollande is a bare king, but the barefoot and Prince Manuel Valle are forced to assemble a new government, when the former did not last summer.
"And the new will also not last autumn or the winter either," Madja Le Pen told reporters.
She conceded the appeal of her party for the dissolution of parliament, saying that she is sure that the party can easily win early elections and is ready to govern.
The ruling party of France survived the slender in the March municipal elections, and the far-right National Front came first in the EU elections in May.
The Sunday Journal du Dimanche found that 76 per cent of the French believe that the Socialist Party is at risk dissipating into several rival factions until Mr. Hollande's late presidential term in 2017.
Pascal Perrín, a political scientist at the University of Xianx Po, warned that the French will quickly lose their patience, if the new socialist government does not manage to rectify the economy and record unemployment.
“He has not enough time, but public opinion needs to quickly feel that something is being changed,” he warned.
Otherwise, the situation may get even worse.
"City without drugs" was left without a lawsuit
Sverdlovsk arbitral tribunal left unconstitute the claim of the administrative directorate of the regional ministry for the management of state-of-Agrivanal property to the fund “City without drugs”.
The Agency intended to recover more than 7 million rubles from the organization as a fee for renting a building in the center of Yekaterinburg.
The plaintiff didn't go to court twice.
Today the arbitration court of the Sverdlovsk region left without consideration the claim of the Executive Directorate of the Ministry for the management of the state property of the region (MUGISO) to the fund “City without drugs” (one of the founding – the mayor of Yekaterinburg Yevgeny Roizman).
The representatives of the regional authorities intended to recover 7.3 million rubles from the organization as a fee for the rental of the building.
Today it became known that the plaintiff twice did not appear in the court, because of which it was decided to retaliate.
The reason for the absence of representatives in the MUGISO Directorate could not be explained, the head of the legal department Maxim Titov did not respond to phone calls.
Representatives of the fund also could not be contacted.
We will remind, we are talking about the mansion, which was occupied by a fund in the city center on Belinskoye street, 19 free of charge since 2011.
This decision was made by the ex-Governor Alexander Misharin.
In November of 2012, the autationary Directorate of the Ministry for State Property Management of the Sverdlovsk region filed a lawsuit in the Sverdlovsk arbitration court for eviction of the fund from the building.
According to the claim, the department demanded through the court to recognize the contract of gratuitous use as unconcluded by the premises of the memorial mansion.
According to the MUGISO Directorate, the agreement did not specify essential conditions for the lease of a cultural heritage object.
Sverdlovsk arbitral tribunal rejected the claim, then an appeal was lodged before the 17-th arbitration court of Perm, which was satisfied.
Subsequently, in the same court the Fund filed a cassation appeal against this decision, which remained unsatisfied, after which the decision was appealed by the fund in the Supreme Arbitration Court, but the court took the side of the directorate.
In 2013, a new lease agreement was concluded, according to which the Fund again began to pay rent, the head of the city Evgeny Royzman said.
The rent was assigned 300 thousand rubles. per month.
The previous administration of the region has donated this building for greasile use, declaring our merchandise in the fight against drugs, as a sign of respect for the fund.
“The current administration has decided otherwise,” he said.
Tatyana Drokhaeva, Yekaterinyburg
why the mayor of Yekaterinburg was asked to leave voluntarily
On July 24, the Deputy of the Yekaterinburg City Duma Alexander Kosintstsev proposed to the mayor of the city - the speaker of the city Duma Yevgeny Roizman to resign.
The reason was the criminal case in relation to the arrested on suspicion of the murder of a retired deputy of the city Duma Oleg Kinev, who is considered an allege of the mayor.
How Evgeny Roizman found a criminal case
On July 1, it became known about the initiation of a criminal case on the influencies (Art. 128.1 of the criminal code of the Russian Federation) in the blog of Yekaterinburg Mayor Yevgeny Royzman.
This was reported in the GU of the interior Ministry in the Sverdlovsk region, where the general director of the legal center “Protection” Anna Filatova made a corresponding statement.
According to her, Mr. Roizman blamed her in his blog entries that she was involved in the crimes allegedly committed by her ex-husband.
