Hackers intercepted the management of the device and demanded a ransom from the owners.
In this case, Apple told the media that in this case the security of the cloud was not compromised, but did not carry out investigations about how users lost their accounts.
In Russia was also previously hacked by the Twitter of the Prime Minister of the Russian Federation Dmitry Medvedev.
