It holds its leading position in the current season.
According to the rules in order to perform at the 2016 Olympics in Rio de Janeiro, she will need to obtain a special permission from the Olympic Committee of Ukraine.
Anna Buryak is not the first Ukrainian athlete who has changed citizenship.
